Package: terra
Type: Package
Title: Minimal 'terra' Stand-in for NetLogoR in webR
Version: 1.9.27.9001
Description: NetLogoR imports 'terra', but the webR build of 'terra' cannot
    currently be loaded, and Fashion Market only uses NetLogoR's
    matrix-based worlds. This package supplies the small part of the 'terra'
    API those code paths use (extents, planar point distances, and the
    nrow/ncol generics) in plain R. Raster conversions and plotting stop with
    an explanatory error.
License: GPL (>= 3)
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Imports: methods
Encoding: UTF-8
